'''Marmod''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[World Trigger Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Marmod
|image = E 619.png
|appearance = [[World Trigger Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 100¢ - 395¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy appears to be a white quadrupedal creature with an eye in its mouth. It has low overall stats. Even with its [[Omni Strike]], the most it can reach are your meatshields. If it does reach your attackers however, it can [[Slow|slow]] them for 3 seconds.

==Strategy==
As long as your World Trigger units are well leveled, these shouldn't be much of a problem. [[Yuma Kuga & Cat (Rare Cat)|Yuma Kuga]] in particular can be used to deal high damage to it, while [[Osamu Mikumo & Cat (Rare Cat)|Osamu Mikumo]] can protect him using his high health and [[Immune to Slow|Slow Immmunity]].

